    "title": "Counter-demo to far-right anti-migration 'pink protest'",
    "text": "Saeed Pourreza\nPress TV, London\nIn London, a group of women have led a counter-protest against a far-right group staging what they call a “pink protest.”\nThe demonstrators say refugees are being scapegoated by the far-right, and that women’s rights are being weaponized to push an anti-immigrant agenda.",
